### Create Agent
POST http://localhost:3001/api/agents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "John Doe",
  "phone": "+911234560000",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "serviceArea": "Bengaluru Central"
}

###

### List Agents
GET http://localhost:3001/api/agents?page=1&limit=10
Accept: application/json

###

### List with status filter
GET http://localhost:3001/api/agents?status=ACTIVE&page=1&limit=5
Accept: application/json

###

### Search by name
GET http://localhost:3001/api/agents?q=John
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Single Agent (replace id below)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/agents/REPLACE_WITH_REAL_ID
Accept: application/json

###

### Update Agent (replace id below)
PATCH http://localhost:3001/api/agents/REPLACE_WITH_REAL_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceArea": "Mumbai West",
  "status": "INACTIVE"
}

###

### Delete Agent (replace id below)
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/agents/REPLACE_WITH_REAL_ID

###

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3001/health

###

### ── Error Cases ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### 400 – Invalid email
POST http://localhost:3001/api/agents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Bad Email",
  "phone": "+919999990001",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "serviceArea": "Nowhere"
}

###

### 400 – Invalid UUID param
GET http://localhost:3001/api/agents/not-a-valid-uuid

###

### 404 – Agent not found
GET http://localhost:3001/api/agents/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

###

### 409 – Duplicate email
POST http://localhost:3001/api/agents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Duplicate",
  "phone": "+919999990002",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "serviceArea": "Anywhere"
}

###
